  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Count Me In Too</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will aim at directly improving the lives of women and girls and survivors and victims of SGBV through the use of Transformative Masculinity and interrogation of alcohol as a cause and effect of SGBV. The projects aims at contributing to the creation of an environment of gender equality where women and girl&#x2019;s right to a life free of violence is respected, upheld and protected. The project seeks to reduce consequences of harmful alcohol consumption such as HIV/AIDS.</narrative>
  </description>
